        sun: { a: 'Praise and everlasting glory be to God the Father, and the Son: with the Holy Paraclete, to ages of ages.', cap: ['2 Corinthians 13', 'The grace of the Lord Jesus Christ, and the love of God, and the communion of the Holy Ghost, be with us all.'], r: 'R. Incline my heart, O God: * unto Thy testimonies.\nV. Turn away mine eyes, lest they behold vanity, and quicken Thou me in Thy way.\nR. Unto Thy testimonies.\nV. Glory be to the Father, and to the Son: and to the Holy Ghost.\nR. Incline my heart, O God: unto Thy testimonies.', v: 'V. I said, Lord, be merciful unto me.\nR. Heal my soul, for I have sinned against Thee.' },
