      S: ['Within the veil, O Lord, Thy Saints cry: Alleluia. Alleluia. Alleluia.', 'R. Right dear in the sight of the Lord: * Alleluia. Alleluia.\nV. Is the death of His Saints.\nR. Alleluia. Alleluia.\nV. Glory be to the Father, and to the Son: and to the Holy Ghost.\nR. Right dear in the sight of the Lord: Alleluia. Alleluia.', 'V. Rejoice in the Lord, ye righteous.\nR. For it becometh well the just to be thankful. Alleluia.'],
