        h += sec('Respond', lines(`R. Jesu Christ, Son of the living God: have mercy upon us. * Alleluia. Alleluia.\nV. ${epiTide && d <= 13 ? 'Thou Who to-day didst appear to the world.' : 'Thou that didst vouchsafe to be born of a Virgin.'}\nR. Have mercy upon us. Alleluia. Alleluia.\nV. Glory be to the Father, and to the Son: and to the Holy Ghost.\nR. Jesu Christ, Son of the living God, have mercy upon us. Alleluia. Alleluia.`));
