        h += sec('The Office of Chapter', lines("V. Right dear in the sight of the Lord.\nR. Is the death of His Saints.\nV. O God, make speed to save us.\nR. O Lord, make haste to help us. (Said three times.)\nV. Glory be to the Father, and to the Son: and to the Holy Ghost.\nR. As it was in the beginning, is now, and ever shall be: world without end. Amen.\nLord, have mercy. Christ, have mercy. Lord, have mercy.\nOur Father (said silently; the priest says aloud:)\nV. And lead us not into temptation.\nR. But deliver us from evil.\nV. And let Thy loving mercy come also unto me, O Lord.\nR. Even Thy salvation, according unto Thy word.\nV. And shew Thy servants Thy work.\nR. And their children Thy glory.\nV. And the glorious Majesty of the Lord our God be upon us.\nR. And prosper Thou the work of our hands upon us: O prosper Thou our handywork.\nLet us pray.\nAlmighty and everlasting God, direct our actions according to Thy good pleasure; that through the Name of Thy beloved Son we may be found worthy to abound in good works: Who liveth and reigneth with Thee in the unity of the Holy Ghost, God, world without end. Amen.\n" + C_BLESS));
        return h;
